    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "S\nSYDNEY\nDong Kingman, the award winning Chinese-American artist, travels the world sketching and painting\nthe beautiful, the monumental and the picturesque. His watercolors grace more than forty\npermanent museum and private collections in the USA and abroad\nAUSTRALIA can provide the visitor with a range of experiences from attending cultural events in the\nSydney Opera House, pictured here, to visiting aboriginal tribes in the Outback. This continent, as\nlarge as the United States, encompasses many aspects; The Great Barrier Reef, marvelous skiing in\nJuly just 200 miles south of Sydney; bountiful gems and strange animals and birds. Unique flora and\nfauna are here in marvelous abundance. Pan Am serves Sydney and Melbourne from Los Angeles,\nSan Francisco, New York, London, Auckland, Honolulu, and Nadi.\nPANAM.\n2007.054.011",
      "SYDNEY\nKinG MAn\nDONG KINGMAN",
      "Cocktaiko\nSherry\nDubonnet Campari\nManhattan Gin Martini Vodka Martini Vermouth\nBloody Mary Screwdriver Whiskey Sour\nTom Collins Vodka Collins Daiquiri Scotch Bourbon\nCanadian Gin Vodka Rum Premium Beer\nMenus\nApéritif\nSelected Gourmet Delicacies\n#****\nRoast au Vol\nA selected cut of aged beef\nroasted on board and carved to order\n750 O-2N\nSeafood Platter\nCold Lush Seafood with a Tangy Japanese Sauce\n15#04\nBreast of Chicken Orienta\nSteamed Rice\nCoffee\n3-t-\nTrout Grenobloise\nTrout Sauteed with Capers, Lemon, Butter and Fresh Parsley\nPlat du Jour\nButtered Vegetable Bouquet\nPotatoes Maison\nTossed Garden Salad\n#**#\nSelection of Cheeses and Fruits\nDessert\nTea\nGreen Tea\n* *\nDecaffeinated Coffee\na-E-\n**\nSelected French Wines\nFrench Champagne Brut\nDrambuie\nAmaretto di Saronno Bénédictine\nCrème de Menthe Cognac VSOP\nContreau\n236 KJC00-"
